    "head_branch": "main",
    "head_commit_message": "chore(sim-checks): require the standard digest equal on arm64 and x86-64 (#749)\n\nSpec 42 step 1 (Decision 161): with outcomes allowed to change, matching\nthe base's digests no longer guards them, so \"the same result on any\nhardware\" gets a check of its own. `digests-arm64` builds the digest on\nGitHub's arm64 runner and takes the `standard` set (the only set that\ntends; it also seeks and routs). `hardware` compares it with the\n`digests` job's x86-64 digest via check_hardware.py, failing with the\nset and the first run and tick that differ. The other sets stay x86-64.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi5atBJUT4QtmFCeGA3\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
